				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Greetings.
<br />

<br />
I am Deuronn Goodfellow, Barbarian Warrior of the 68th level with 105 AA's. Those AA's were placed upon the recommendation of my Raid leader, Bollix Breaker, to maximize my usefulness as a tank for raid purposes. My Magelo is: 
<br />
<a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=718140" target="_blank" class="postlink">http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=718140</a> . As you can see, it has been awhile since my profile has been updated.  I tried today to update it by logging in, however I struck out. Magelo is not "Patched" for some reason.
<br />

<br />
To continue.  
<br />

<br />
I have made the move to Morden Rasp, based on what I saw here in your very own message boards.  
<br />

<br />
To be frank, the merge has left me with utter disdain for EQ.  I play and do not enjoy it.  I have started WoW and that does pique my interest very much, but I miss so many of those that have gone.  That is why I came here.  I saw CoTW moving here and I wanted to give it one last chance.  I guess I am just not ready to give up on the game.  However, I SERIOUSLY don't want to deal with the BS that has become "Zek".
<br />

<br />
Guild history is as follows:
<br />
Maloudi Clan  (Officer)  (Was there to help rebuild the guild. Long story, perhaps it belongs in the Roleplay Forum)
<br />
Mystery Assistance (Officer) 
<br />
Chaotic Neutrals (Officer, Leader) (Left MA to help rebuild the guild. Leadership passed to me to continue on)
<br />
Celestial Empire (Officer) (Hung up the hat with Chaotic Neutrals, joined CE.  Probably from there many of you know me.)
<br />
Transcendency (Officer) (CE was shutting down, I felt Trans was closest to us with progression, was unsure with relationship with CoTW, I wanted to help)
<br />

<br />
And here I am.  Alone on Morden Rasp.
<br />

<br />
I am fully Elemental Flagged. VT, EMP keyed.  I have some other trials in GoD and that Winds.  Other than that, I did not buy the very newest expansion.  Didn't think it would be worth the money.
<br />

<br />
Anywho, this old warrior is rambling.  Basically it boils down to this:
<br />

<br />
I am coming here because friends are here.  I am not a main tank. My role in CE was primarily a backup tank, pickup mob.  I made sure the main tank GOT to the raid target in one piece.  That was my job, I performed it well.  I stepped in if the MT went down.  I also perfomed the duties of MA.  I have no aspirations to be the MT.  I like what I do.  You all know I was recruitment leader for CE.  
<br />

<br />
I was on RZ for close to 4 years now (Would have been in May, I believe) On Deu. slowly leveling.  Tro can vouch for that.
<br />

<br />
Should you have any questions, please shoot me a tell in game.
<br />

<br />
Sincerely,
<br />

<br />
Deuronn Goodfellow
